our food is real and I can eat it, then whenever my head comes off, I could build up nutrients and grow my head back"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["on overnight if I wanted to, that's all.  As long as the food's real, I'll manage.  Sometimes I need extra.\""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"I'm half-dragon.  These are my friends and my girlfriend.  We need five rooms for the night.\""]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[20]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["People1",5,1,2,"Innkeeper"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Welcome.  I am programmed to offer you rooms to safely rest in, 24 hours a day.  I will also tell you that I"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["apologize again for how spartan the place is, as it was picked and established as a rush-job.\""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"You said you need only five rooms?  I'm confused, as I currently sense six of you.\""]},{"code":231,"indent":1,"parameters":[1,"Wood1",0,0,0,0,200,200,255,0]},{"code":231,"indent":1,"parameters":[2,"2Room2",0,0,0,0,200,200,255,0]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[22]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Me and my girlfriend like to share the same bedroom.  We're like that.\""]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[20]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["People1",5,1,2,"Innkeeper"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"I can certainly put the two of you in the same room like that, it should be no problem at all.\""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Do you have ID?  You must be at least 22 years old to get a room for the night by yourselves at this establishment.\""]},{"code":231,"indent":1,"parameters":[1,"Wood1",0,0,0,0,200,200,255,0]},{"code":231,"indent":1,"parameters":[2,"2Room2",0,0,0,0,200,200,255,0]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[22]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Although she's a robot, and probably one programmed by Benny Zinkland, she seems harmless enough and you don't feel"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["too worried about identifying yourself here or whether or not you'll get your Driver's License back if you hand it"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["to her."]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[23]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"No problem ma'am.  Here's my Driver's License.  I turned 22 earlier this year, during the summer."]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["My girlfriend is 22 too, and the rest of my friends are about the same age, give or take a little.  But \\P[3] is only 21, for just a month -"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Is that okay?  I thought you could get a hotel or motel room at 16 in Acrydia anyways.\""]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[52]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[6]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"They recently changed the laws for that in Acrydia.  Didn't you see the news?  Besides, this isn't Acrydia anyways, just a made-up fantasy land"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["thrown together by Benny Zinkland, so who knows what the law is supposed to be.\""]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[20]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["People1",5,1,2,"Innkeeper"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["(The InnKeeper suddenly starts getting weird and robot-like for a moment.)"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Error.  This data is inconsistent with what the almighty divine creator Benny Zinkland has programmed me with."]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["I was given data from the divine Benny Zinkland that all of you are currently 22 years of age, at this time.\""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"I am not prepared for this contingency.  Error.\""]},{"code":231,"indent":1,"parameters":[1,"Wood1",0,0,0,0,200,200,255,0]},{"code":231,"indent":1,"parameters":[2,"2Room2",0,0,0,0,200,200,255,0]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[28]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[3]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Sounds like Benny doesn't know us as well as he thought he did.  I woulda thought he"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["would remember our birthdays, after hanging out with us in junior high school.\""]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[23]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Guess not.\""]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[25]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\P[2]"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"We're sorry ma'am.  \\P[3] will be 22 in a month.  Is there any way you could let him have a room anyways?  Perhaps we could sign anything"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["for him?  His parents aren't available in this place.\""]},{"code":117,"indent":1,"parameters":[20]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["People1",5,1,2,"Innkeeper"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Error.  Attempting to resolve with onboard Magical Intelligence.\""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":[""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Conclusion has been accomplished.  Re-establishing conversation from prior accumulated progress.\""]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"Re-engaging MI personality.  One moment.\""]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["People1",5,1,2,"Innkeeper"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Suddenly the Innkeeper seems more life-like and less plastic again, but only so much."]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["She smiles."]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\"I think I can let him slide, and charge the usual amount.  He's probably mature enough, and I'm not expecting any problems.\""]},{"code":4